nd harnessing it the right  way and that's on tomlin and then tom if  tomlin pulls that off then maybe he  should have a job for life but if he  fails this year this may be the time to  start thinking about the fourth coach in  51 years  listen i think that we are in that spot  for the steelers where it's addition by  subtraction with antonio brown and how  it all went down in all the reports and  i am not sympathetic towards ben we've  talked about him at the beginning of  this segment where  you know roethlisberger deserves a lot  of the criticism but in terms of a  day-to-day stress antonio brown going to  the raiders will probably help the  steelers in 2019  phenomenal wide receiver top wide  receiver in the game you can make the  argument you know top three at least but  at some point the distractions get too  much  and i i do think they'll have a little  bit of addition by subtraction because  there's still a ton of talent on the  roster and now you don't have the  headache of antonio brown week to week  what type of mood is he going to be in  on tuesday practice why what type of  mood is he going to be in on the walk  through on saturday will he show up on  sunday is he going to play like you know  there's all these questions and now  they're going to have that eliminated  and get back to football  and also they're going to be paying  attention everything antonio brown does  with the raiders and uh enjoying from  afar if that ends up being the kind of  mess that it could be all right we're  gonna take a break when we return nick  bosa deleted some tweets that were  political in nature should he or any  other athlete be expected to go back and  delete tweets and keep their political  views to themselves as they approach the  draft we'll discuss that when pft live  continues right after this  [Music]  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

